# Cloudflare Pages response headers for the web build (copied into dist/ by trunk).
# Trunk puts a content hash in the .js/.wasm file names, so Pages' default caching
# (revalidate with ETag) is already correct and no Cache-Control rules are needed here.
# GPS > "This device" uses the browser's location; no other device permission is needed.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=()
